<title>UK: BP LPG prices for Sep - propane 185, butane 180.</title>
<headline>BP LPG prices for Sep - propane 185, butane 180.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BP announced its BP Agreed Price (BPAP) for LPG on Friday afternoon.</p>
<p>Propane for September will be priced at $185 a tonne, with butane at $180 a tonne.</p>
<p>This compares with $165 a tonne for each grade in August.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
